        "kind": "talk",
        "npcId": "mai",
        "mapId": "a-split-road"
      },
      {
        "text": "Seventeen Blue Snails spawn across A Split Road; ten kills are needed. Blue Snails are level 2 and slightly tougher than the regular Snails from Sam's Suggestion, but still well within a Beginner's range.",
