        "mobId": "blue-snail",
        "qty": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Fourteen Shrooms spawn on the same map. Shrooms hit slightly harder than Blue Snails and the player will likely need to drink a Red Potion or two if leveled at 1 or 2.",
        "kind": "kill",
        "mobId": "shroom",
        "qty": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Eleven Red Snails spawn on the same map; five kills are needed. Red Snails are level 4 and the highest-difficulty monster on A Split Road.",
        "kind": "kill",
        "mobId": "red-snail",
        "qty": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "With all three kill counters complete, speak to Mai again to hand in the quest.",
        "kind": "deliver",
        "npcId": "mai",
        "mapId": "a-split-road"
